[{"type": "chat", "time": 5280.475, "timestamp": "01:28:00", "author": "@saikatdey0909", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mT2Up10wsYYwilcayEwYxOCwTgzDSnNztFejTB-x02nR8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello orange it's been a while how have you been"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5282.95, "timestamp": "01:28:02", "text": "我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5284.87, "timestamp": "01:28:04", "text": "意思是，你可以享受賞櫻的樂趣，比如沿著小路賞櫻"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5285.249, "timestamp": "01:28:05", "author": "@saikatdey0909", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mT2Up10wsYYwilcayEwYxOCwTgzDSnNztFejTB-x02nR8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5288.31, "timestamp": "01:28:08", "text": "什麼的，如果櫻花掉到你身上，你可以玩玩，但是千萬不要去推"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5296.229, "timestamp": "01:28:16", "text": "搡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5298.95, "timestamp": "01:28:18", "text": "櫻花樹，讓它掉下來，或者折斷樹枝，因為有些地方可能沒有明文規定禁止這樣做，但這仍然是不尊重自然的行為，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5302.07, "timestamp": "01:28:22", "text": "所以你不應該這樣做。有些地方雖然沒有明文規定，但如果有人，特別是遊客，會覺得“哦，這可不是鬧著玩的”，因為在這裡，尤其是在像這樣的地方，當"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5303.41, "timestamp": "01:28:23", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "surviving from work. hope you are well saikat o7"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5305.99, "timestamp": "01:28:25", "text": "你摘花的時候，他們不會說"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5314.79, "timestamp": "01:28:34", "text": "什麼。是的。但是，並沒有這樣的規定，但在某些地方，我認為有人會強行規定你不應該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5321.11, "timestamp": "01:28:41", "text": "拔毛之類的。但據我所知，我沒看到任何類似的東西。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5328.87, "timestamp": "01:28:48", "text": "我們不會那麼做，因為就像你正在享受其他人的樂趣一樣，例如如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5332.229, "timestamp": "01:28:52", "text": "我正在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5334.07, "timestamp": "01:28:54", "text": "欣賞這棵櫻桃樹，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5335.51, "timestamp": "01:28:55", "text": "我離開了，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5337.748, "timestamp": "01:28:57", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "was it the jake paul video? 💀"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5337.99, "timestamp": "01:28:57", "text": "其他人也想欣賞"}]